# A hold mined and docked by hand, with the keys a player presses (hand-mining.toml is
# the same route headless). W flies up to the first rock, and a click on a rock across
# the field says it is out of reach. Space held puts the beam on the first rock, chips
# fly back up the beam to the nose, each unit lands in the hold with an amber puff and a
# count, and the seventh cuts it down. A turn and a short run put the nose on the big
# east seam, whose soft stone cuts faster; held on it, it glazes and the rest comes slowly,
# and it fills the hold. Turned onto Lantern Dock, W flies her there; a touch re-aims
# her, and W let go coasts the ship slowly into its glowing ring and the clamps take her
# in with a puff. Ten notes.
